{"id":106,"name":"Karrota Archive","slug":"karrota-archive","logo":"storage/clients/karrota-archive-c1c17dc1a9.png","featured_image":"storage/projects/its-good-to-be-an-albanian-c018fc1c78.jpg","title":null,"description":null,"website":null,"location":"locally","services":[{"name":"Branding","slug":"branding"},{"name":"Animation","slug":"animation"},{"name":"Campaign","slug":"campaign"},{"name":"S. Media","slug":"s-media"},{"name":"Strategy","slug":"strategy"}],"industries":[{"name":"Produce","slug":"produce"},{"name":"Public","slug":"public"},{"name":"Food","slug":"food"},{"name":"Awareness","slug":"awareness"}],"projects":[{"id":216,"title":"All of the Brands","slug":"all-brands","year":"2024","description":"We have branded giants, even named some of them. This is the collection of all the brands we have created over the years, bursting with love and care.","body_html":null,"cover_image":"storage/projects/all-brands-7b969a9c5d.jpg","is_featured":false,"services":["Branding"],"industries":[],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","data":{"content":"<p>Throughout the years, we have helped create identities for many companies, NGOs and other enterprises in nearly every field: from food to sports, to public service, to nation branding, to finance and technology, since 2005.</p>"}},{"type":"paragraph","data":{"content":"<p>We have named some and been there with them from day one. Some others we have re-branded, taking them to another level. Many of them are giants today, a few, sadly, ceased to exist, but each and every brand below was created with so much care and love, they all mark a piece of history. </p>"}},{"type":"separator","data":[]},{"type":"heading","data":{"level":"h2","text":"2016 - 2025"}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-279204b47f.jpg","alt":""}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-0101e9c2f3.jpg","alt":""}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-30717810d9.jpg","alt":"