at love opens windows that weren’t there before, windows that bring in life, happiness, health and care.","body_html":null,"cover_image":"storage/projects/drena-bfdbdd8637.jpg","is_featured":false,"services":["Campaign","S. Media"],"industries":["Produce","Food"],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","data":{"content":"<p><strong>Drena </strong>is a 100% organic milk producer and other dairy products. This company has been rapidly growing over the last 6 years in Kosovo’s food industry, choosing us to re-brand, maintain and promote its brand.</p>"}},{"type":"separator","data":[]},{"type":"heading","data":{"level":"h2","text":"Love Opens Windows That Weren’t There Before"}},{"type":"paragraph","data":{"content":"<p>Last year had us locked in, finding out that love opens windows that weren’t there before, windows that bring in life, happiness, health and care. </p>"}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-53907ebc2a.jpg","alt":""}},{"type":"paragraph","data":{"content":"<p>The gradual opening from the pandemic lockdown has inspired us to create the \"windows\" campaign through a TV commercial, billboards and social media.</p>"}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-110a9932db.jpg","alt":""}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-4c88149020.jpg","alt":""}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-db586d876a.jpg","alt":""}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-7e54da6f35.jpg","alt":""}}]},{"id":128,"title":"It's good to be an Albanian","slug":"its-good-to-be-an-albanian","year":"2004","description":"Created for Tifozat Kuq e Zi\n\nLogo design for \"Tifozat Kuq e Zi\", fans of the Albanian National Team, which has now become the identifying mark of all Albanian sports fans worldwide, and is used everywhere on flags, jerseys, t-shirts, hats, scarves and other equipment.","body_html":null,"cover_image":"storage/projects/its-good-to-be-an-albanian-c018fc1c78.jpg","is_featured":false,"services":["Branding"],"industries":[],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","data":{"content":"<p>Created for Tifozat Kuq e Zi</p>"}},{"type":"paragraph","data":{"content":"<p>Logo design for \"Tifozat Kuq e Zi\", fans of the Albanian National Team, which has now become the identifying mark of all Albanian sports fans worldwide, and is used everywhere on flags, jerseys, t-shirts, hats, scarves and other equipment.</p>"}},{"type":"image","data":{"image":"storage/projects/page-content/img-0320220b90.png","alt":""}}]}]}